          %p
            is a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+square"} pullback square
          %p
            This property of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sets"} sets
            can now be stated in purely categorical terms. We use
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
