                            %mo ^
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{\mathbb{C}} \to \widehat{\mathbb{D}}
              %li
                %p
                #enumiEb.num_enume
                %p
                  It turns out that, for any
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
