            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/frame"} frame
            is a pointless
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/space"} space
            %em maps
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/frames"} frames
            are the wrong way round. So we introduce a new word—
