                  \\mathbf{TopSp}\stackrel{\mathbf{Open}}{\to } \mathbf{Loc}\stackrel{\mathbf{Sh}}{\to } \mathbf{Topos}.
          %p This is the two-step process mentioned above.
          %p
            Whenever I have said ‘modulo a small lie’, you can interpret that as ‘use
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locales"} locales
            instead of
            = succeed "\u2019." do
