              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Sub
                    %mi ℰ
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{Sub}_{\mathcal{E}}(1)
            is not trivial. For instance, take
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
