                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P = \{ (x, y) \:|\:x y = 1 \}
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mrow
                    %mtable{:displaystyle => "false", :rowspacing => "0.5ex"}
                      %mtr
